{"id":"particulie_rement","lemma":"particulièrement","pos":"adv","rank":2299,"glosses":["particularly, specifically","especially","in particular"],"ipa":"/paʁ.ti.ky.ljɛʁ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/Fr-particuli%C3%A8rement.ogg/Fr-particuli%C3%A8rement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je ne veux pas particulièrement le faire.","en":"I don't particularly want to do it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Ce livre est particulièrement difficile à lire.","en":"This book is especially difficult to read.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Elle aime particulièrement la musique.","en":"She especially likes music.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"music"}]},{"text":"Je ne ressens pas particulièrement la faim.","en":"I'm not feeling particularly hungry.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to feel","l":"ressentir"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"Je ne me sens pas particulièrement nerveux.","en":"I don't feel particularly nervous.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"meaning, sense"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"nerve"}]}]}